  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WEDO - Ensuring Gender Just Climate Action Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WEDO works to strengthen gender equality in national and international climate policies and climate financing. DCAD engages with WEDO through its expertise and advocacy on gender equality in international climate processes and national policy implementation. WEDO connects DCAD to a wide network of women&#x2019;s groups, including organisations in LDCs and SIDS, and the Women and Gender Constituency (WGC) in the UN Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC). WEDO also represents the gender network in the world&#x2019;s largest climate fund, the Green Climate Fund, advocating for transparency and effectiveness of climate finance and improved access for locally based projects and actions</narrative>
  </description>
